@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 8: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/reactivate (Nuevo intento sobre una nota cerrada)

actor "Supervisor CX" as Supervisor
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_approval_levels DB" as LevelsCfgDB
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Supervisor -> Web: Tap en "Reactivar" + motivo obligatorio
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/2001/reactivate\n(ReactivateDto: { reason })
Gateway -> Service: reactivateRefundOrder(refundOrderId: 2001, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(2001)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { status: 'REJECTED', total: 800.00,\ncurrent_workflow_instance_id: 90 }

Service -> Service: 2. assertCanReactivate(order, actor, payload)
note right of Service
  409 si order.status no es 'REJECTED'
  (APPROVED y ANNULLED no se reactivan)
  422 si falta reason
  403 si el actor no tiene el rol habilitado
end note

Service -> LevelsCfgDB: 3. findActiveApprovalLadder(order.total)
note right of LevelsCfgDB
  Se vuelve a leer la configuración vigente:
  el intento nuevo puede tomar una escalera
  distinta de la del intento anterior.
end note
LevelsCfgDB --> Service: ladder[]

Service -> TX: 4. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> InstanceDB: 5. insertWorkflowInstance(2001, attempt: previous + 1, 'IN_APPROVAL', currentLevelOrder: 1)
note right of InstanceDB
  - attempt = intento anterior + 1
  - reactivated_from_instance_id = 90
  El intento viejo NO se toca: queda
  REJECTED como evidencia.
end note
InstanceDB --> Service: newInstanceId: 91

Service -> LevelsDB: 6. insertInstanceLevelsSnapshot(91, ladder)
note right of LevelsDB
  TODOS los niveles del intento nuevo van
  con decision_mode = 'DOCUMENT_DECISION'.
  La selección de ítems ocurrió una sola vez,
  en el nivel 1 del primer intento, y no
  vuelve a mostrarse.
end note
LevelsDB --> Service: levelIds[]

Service -> OrdersDB: 7. updateRefundOrder(2001, status: 'OPEN', currentWorkflowInstanceId: 91)
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> ActionsDB: 8. insertWorkflowAction(91, NULL, 'REACTIVATE')
note right of ActionsDB
  - reason obligatorio
  - previous_status = 'REJECTED'
  - new_status = 'IN_APPROVAL'
  - actor_employee_code / actor_role_code
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 9. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (ReactivateResult:\n{ instanceId: 91, attempt, currentLevelOrder: 1 })
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK
Web --> Supervisor: Nota reactivada • Intento 2 en curso, sin selección de ítems
@enduml
